{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HEB","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"希伯来书","commonName":"希伯来书","title":"希伯来书","order":58,"numberOfChapters":13,"sha256":"2c6f2c6885c0d90704c9582e6fe7720be42b3b4d3b820007897ccb662d08a6fa","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HEB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":13,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HEB/13.json","totalNumberOfVerses":303},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["这么大的救恩"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["所以，我们当越发郑重所听见的道理，恐怕我们随流失去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["那借着天使所传的话既是确定的；凡干犯悖逆的都受了该受的报应。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我们若忽略这么大的救恩，怎能逃罪呢？这救恩起先是主亲自讲的，后来是听见的人给我们证实了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["神又按自己的旨意，用神迹、奇事和百般的异能，并圣灵的恩赐，同他们作见证。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["救恩的元帅"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["我们所说将来的世界， 神原没有交给天使管辖。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["但有人在经上某处证明说：",{"text":"人算什么，你竟顾念他？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世人算什么，你竟眷顾他？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你叫他比天使微小一点","poem":1},{"noteId":1},{"text":"，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"赐他荣耀尊贵为冠冕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并将你手所造的都派他管理，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叫万物都服在他的脚下。","poem":1},"既叫万物都服他，就没有剩下一样不服他的。只是如今我们还不见万物都服他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["惟独见那成为比天使小一点的耶稣",{"noteId":2},"；因为受死的苦，就得了尊贵荣耀为冠冕，叫他因着 神的恩，为人人尝了死味。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["原来那为万物所属、为万物所本的，要领许多的儿子进荣耀里去，使救他们的元帅，因受苦难得以完全，本是合宜的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["因那使人成圣的和那些得以成圣的，都是出于一。所以，他称他们为弟兄也不以为耻，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["说：",{"text":"我要将你的名传与我的弟兄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在会中我要颂扬你；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["又说：",{"text":"我要倚赖他；","poem":1},"又说：",{"text":"看哪，我与 神所给我的儿女。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["儿女既同有血肉之体，他也照样亲自成了血肉之体，特要借着死败坏那掌死权的，就是魔鬼，"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["并要释放那些一生因怕死而为奴仆的人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["他并不救拔天使，乃是救拔亚伯拉罕的后裔。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["所以，他凡事该与他的弟兄相同，为要在 神的事上成为慈悲忠信的大祭司，为百姓的罪献上挽回祭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["他自己既然被试探而受苦，就能搭救被试探的人。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":1,"caller":"-","text":"或译：你叫他暂时比天使小","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":7}},{"noteId":2,"caller":"-","text":"或译：惟独见耶稣暂时比天使小","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":9}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HEB/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HEB/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HEB/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}